---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "March 4, 2026";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50"
      >
        ← Back
      </a>
      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl"
      >
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        1. Acceptance
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        By accessing or using Reviu, you agree to these Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        2. Service Overview
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Reviu provides a desktop Git client with a Free plan and a Pro
        subscription for GitHub-related workflows.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        3. Subscriptions and Trial
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        <li>Pro price: $19 per month.</li>
        <li>Pro includes a 14-day free trial.</li>
        <li>No payment method is required to start the free trial.</li>
        <li>
          After the trial, a paid subscription starts only when you add payment
          details.
        </li>
        <li>
          Once activated, the subscription auto-renews monthly until canceled.
        </li>
        <li>
          Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        4. Billing Provider
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Subscription billing is handled through Polar and its payment partners.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        5. Refund Policy
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Payments are non-refundable, except where refunds are required by
        mandatory applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        6. Acceptable Use
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        You agree not to misuse the service, interfere with service operations,
        or use Reviu in violation of applicable laws.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        7. Third-Party Services
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Reviu integrates with third-party platforms and infrastructure
        providers, including GitHub, Polar, and Hetzner. Availability and
        behavior may depend on those services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        8. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Reviu is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. To the maximum
        extent permitted by law, Reviu disclaims warranties and limits liability
        for indirect, incidental, special, and consequential damages.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        9. Termination
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        We may suspend or terminate access for serious violations of these Terms
        or legal requirements.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        10. Governing Law and Venue
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Governing law: <code>French law</code>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Competent courts: <code>the courts of Lyon, France </code>
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">11. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        <code>contact@reviu.dev</code>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
